The engine (@openstage/assess) has no third-party runtime dependencies. It
uses only the Node.js standard library.

The plain-text import profile reads the question layout documented in the
test-bank vendor's user guide. That layout is a de facto convention used by many
publisher test banks. No the test-bank vendor code, text or data is included in this
